<title>SINGAPORE: TABLE-Pan-United Corp H1 net down 30 pct.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Pan-United Corp H1 net down 30 pct.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-08-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30, 1997.</p>
<p>		  (in million of S$ unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit				   7.04  vs  10.04</p>
<p>    Dividend (percent)			 nil   vs  nil</p>
<p>    Group share (cents)			1.3   vs   1.8</p>
<p>    Turnover				   107.06  vs 159.09</p>
<p>    Other income (incl. interest)	  1.75  vs   0.52</p>
<p>    Interest expense			   1.10  vs   0.39</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit			    12.90  vs  13.42</p>
<p>    Income from associates		   0.71  vs   0.98</p>
<p>    Minorities				   2.39  vs   0.47</p>
<p>Note: Pan-United Corp Ltd is involved in shipping, ship building and repair services and in activities related to the supply of refined petroleum products for marine and industrial use.</p>
